The page links four other kill chains on csoh.org.

Nx / s1ngularity made the same mistake through the pull request title, eight months later. The page calls Ultralytics the direct ancestor of Mini Shai-Hulud, fourteen months later. LiteLLM and the Hugging Face chain are where the page says the trajectory of AI infrastructure as a target continues.

Its related defense topics are GitHub Actions, CI/CD security, AI/ML security and detection engineering. CI/CD stands for continuous integration and continuous delivery.
